      "text": "// A WORKING HANDOFF From first hello to confirmed booking. The useful part is not one clever AI response. It is the full chain: answering, understanding, updating your records, and telling the right person what happened. P Ops desk Live activity 3 Conversations Automations Customers All systems online Checked just now ACTIVITY / CALL-1048 New appointment enquiry RESOLVED AUTOMATICALLY AM Akosua Mensah Inbound call · 2m 14s CUSTOMER Can I book a consultation for Thursday morning? VOICE AGENT Yes, 10:30 is available. I’ve held it and sent the details to your WhatsApp. Intent: appointment Confid",
      "layout": "centered",
