    },
    {
      "selector": "section",
      "type": "features",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2186,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1381,
      "heading": "AI Voice Agents",
      "backgroundColor": "#0B0C0E",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "TRACK 01 VOICE OPERATIONS AI Voice Agents Voice agents that answer your business line around the clock, booking appointments, qualifying callers, answering the questions you answer twenty times a day, and handing off to a human the moment a call needs one. Call answering Appointment booking Caller qualification Human handoff 24/7 Answer coverage TRACK 02 AGENTS AT WORK Autonomous AI Agents Agents that scout leads, draft follow-ups, prepare proposals, and report on their own work daily. Not a pitch deck concept: this site's own sales engine runs on agents I built, and I build the same disciplin",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
