      ],
      "text": "// EVIDENCE, NOT INVENTED METRICS This site runs the systems it sells. These are working product surfaces you can inspect today. They demonstrate capability; they are not presented as client performance results. LIVE Builder OS Inspect the full multi-agent system live: Lisa, Joan, Sharon, and Jason, each doing real work on this site right now. Open Builder OS → LIVE Browser voice agent Speak with Lisa on the homepage and see the typed fallback, transcript state, and service-aware responses. Try the voice demo → CONNECTED Phone and WhatsApp The same assistant can receive real calls and messages",
      "layout": "centered",
